    "text": "Tuesday, Jan. 20\n6 p.m., the town council will meet at Town Hall. The councilors also will serve as the board of water and sewer commissioners during this session\nWednesday, Jan. 21\n3:30 p.m., the affordable housing committee will meet at Town Hall\n5 p.m., the planning commission will meet at Town Hall\n6:30 p.m., there will be a joint workshop with the planning commission and town council\nThursday, Jan. 22\n6 p.m., the school committee will meet at Town Hall",
